BugInfo.Description:
采用SSL进行连接时，使用`AllowAllHostnameVerifier()`和`SSLSocketFactory.ALLOW_ALL_HOSTNAME_VERIFIER`将会关闭主机名验证功能。这相当于信任所有证书。HostnameVerifier是用于主机名验证的接口,若重写`verify`方法只返回true，意味着信任所有主机名。  

**例1**：下列代码SSLSocketFactory调用`setHostnameVerifier`方法，将`SSLSocketFactory.ALLOW_ALL_HOSTNAME_VERIFIER`作为参数，将会关闭主机名验证功能。  
```java
...  
KeyStore store = KeyStore.getInstance(KeyStore.getDefaultType());    
store.load(null, null);    
SSLSocketFactory sf = new SSLSocketFactory(store);    
sf.setHostnameVerifier(`SSLSocketFactory.`ALLOW_ALL_HOSTNAME_VERIFIER);    
HttpParams params = new BasicHttpParams();    
HttpProtocolParams.setVersion(params, HttpVersion.HTTP_1_1);    
HttpProtocolParams.setContentCharset(params, HTTP.UTF_8);    
SchemeRegistry registry = new SchemeRegistry();    
registry.register(new Scheme("http", PlainSocketFactory.getSocketFactory(), 80));    
registry.register(new Scheme("https", sf, 443));    
ClientConnectionManager ccm = new ThreadSafeClientConnManager(params, registry);    
... 
```
**例2**：下列代码重写HostnameVerifier接口的`verify`方法，方法内只有个一个返回值为true的return语句，意味着主机名验证毫无意义。  
```java
...  
HostnameVerifier hostnameVerifier = new HostnameVerifier() {  
    @Override  
    public boolean verify(String requestedHost, SSLSession remoteServerSession) {  
        return true;   
    }  
};  
...
```

BugInfo.Advice:
采用SSL连接时，不应放弃主机名验证。可考虑采用StrictHostnameVerifer建立服务器身份和安全SSL连接以及正确的重写`verify`方法。  

**例1**：下列代码SSLSocketFactory调用`setHostnameVerifier`方法，将`SSLSocketFactory.STRICT_HOSTNAME_VERIFIER` 作为参数，将会开启严格匹配模式。  
```java
...  
KeyStore store = KeyStore.getInstance(KeyStore.getDefaultType());    
store.load(null, null);    
SSLSocketFactory sf = new SSLSocketFactory(store);    
sf.setHostnameVerifier(SSLSocketFactory.STRICT_HOSTNAME_VERIFIER);    
HttpParams params = new BasicHttpParams();    
HttpProtocolParams.setVersion(params, HttpVersion.HTTP_1_1);    
HttpProtocolParams.setContentCharset(params, HTTP.UTF_8);    
SchemeRegistry registry = new SchemeRegistry();    
registry.register(new Scheme("http", PlainSocketFactory.getSocketFactory(), 80));    
registry.register(new Scheme("https", sf, 443));    
ClientConnectionManager ccm = new ThreadSafeClientConnManager(params, registry);    
...
``` 
**例2**：下列代码正确的重写HostnameVerifier接口的`verify`方法，没有忽略主机名验证。  
```java
...  
HostnameVerifier hostnameVerifier = new HostnameVerifier() {  
    @Override  
    public boolean verify(String requestedHost, SSLSession remoteServerSession) {  
        return requestedHost.equalsIgnoreCase(remoteServerSession.getPeerHost());   
    }  
};  
...
```
